{"objects":[{"id":"flow","instance":"instance--b96dad5f-c519-5a1f-a718-912ca4a86c02","objects":["attack-action--1","attack-action--2","attack-action--3","attack-action--4","attack-action--5","attack-action--6","attack-action--7","attack-action--8","attack-action--9","attack-action--10","attack-action--11","attack-action--12","attack-action--13","attack-condition--1","attack-condition--2","attack-condition--3","attack-operator--1","instance--18acb1e8-0dbc-5fdc-aa7a-664a37ff2675","instance--d56a57e1-38ee-5115-bcad-e7817668513c","software--1","process--1","instance--907e763a-a617-55e3-98dc-cba9f96f12fa","instance--cc6d4da2-b8fb-52bc-8217-2ce7836698a9","instance--ad1f125b-7701-5e9d-b869-79f40471648d","instance--384798bd-a84b-5feb-8d38-7f9d0a087f11","instance--ed6039fe-678b-5ae9-9576-73e6ea35b0c8","instance--a6618e5f-2d2d-55c4-9d60-5edfe63f3ef7","instance--d8c1ac68-9d53-5126-80b0-7decc34c9563","instance--c5209c5e-c2ea-5188-a8a1-ae2e556c4dd3","instance--57bd700a-faa2-5f72-95f2-2694bcea17c9","instance--c075f5c6-95e8-5553-8f7e-b432b96021c7","instance--56da8838-1109-5fce-9d89-7b3ec32d7010","instance--7cc46cbd-beb8-54eb-aef6-32656d039f20","instance--b4989f0a-5dbf-5174-8be8-70c1c05501ed","instance--e28c61d0-be08-595d-b694-80935ffe4433","instance--aaed1ef6-6978-5a66-983b-51be56c74b70","instance--d190f90c-4784-50da-ad09-085edc636fbd","instance--e50a8fe1-abd4-5a55-955f-3ce62e4f786f","instance--13a1d2ce-b971-5f8d-952e-3b059edcaebb","instance--87fa4a6b-4596-5860-918e-e16f74da32fa","instance--6b5651cb-5932-55cd-9dbf-5472ebd10b9f","instance--d65a4028-8d7e-50b3-af5f-7e71c76bb85c","instance--323718cc-4d88-5286-b089-01b112541c05","instance--05a6c3f1-85d8-5a9c-b7ee-77d1baf925ad"],"properties":[["name","Felismus RAT intrusion flow"],["description","This week, my colleagues and I furiously investigated the mystery of Felismus, a sophisticated, well-written piece of malware discovered recently by researchers at Forcepoint Labs."],["scope","campaign"],["author",[["name","Julia Kisielius"]]],["external_references",[["item-1",[["source_name","levelblue.com"],["url","https://levelblue.com/blogs/security-essentials/the-felismus-rat-powerful-threat-mysterious-purpose"]]]]]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--ad592d05-6969-5b51-98a8-1ad9b6aab896","120":"instance--5850a8f4-8241-5e73-9bf0-dcd376cd5025","150":"instance--0da1498f-3beb-5916-a249-e0410a4a81e4","180":"instance--d3632784-7391-5a29-83e2-edab51db56c6","210":"instance--8bc47ca5-ca73-5a04-a9ea-918608f10871","240":"instance--6546eef6-c5ad-516e-a417-89916e651648","270":"instance--244e5a69-f465-564e-9d2c-93d4da44fc57","30":"instance--6a1fca3c-fdb6-536a-bbea-61ac2349a700","300":"instance--043a5b44-2864-5565-abce-1909204e5485","330":"instance--e10eb918-2b0b-56f4-9c82-f345ce21276c","60":"instance--33a99d1b-dad8-51f6-be74-e1614db9151b","90":"instance--380c79e9-b1eb-547c-bf01-a011db1201c1"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--1","properties":[["name","Deliver fake AdobeCMS executable"],["description","Felismus appears to infiltrate systems by posing as an Adobe Content Management System file, as evidenced by the \u201cAdobeCMS.exe\u201d filename present in samples of the malware found in the wild. A malicious actor might fool unsuspecting users into downloading the file by presenting them with an update notice through a compromised ad network or phishing email campaign: \u201cTo view this media content, click here to update to the latest version of Adobe.\u201d"],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0001","technique":"T1566"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--4f4d03a8-4502-5010-997b-9943e254395b","120":"instance--cefe62ac-5b6e-5ead-84fc-b4c632913a73","150":"instance--4d07a740-2467-5b95-ac8d-4a2ee8edd11e","180":"instance--1205f03c-a457-5a0b-87ef-3bbb7aac110f","210":"instance--96e7dc6a-9f86-5f69-8d45-a566303cd4c0","240":"instance--66237af6-bb19-5a51-9fa2-cbc4a96186f5","270":"instance--836dfd42-b475-50ca-9acf-4f11bd32b89f","30":"instance--efe92997-cc5c-538a-90bc-c09ffb1379f4","300":"instance--9c4a24ae-1426-5cb5-9d7c-792e6dd325b7","330":"instance--06c6a74a-ca7d-5703-88ea-a06a0933d21a","60":"instance--5e4f84e5-56b7-5b8f-9bc3-b4d59d371123","90":"instance--019deb6a-bab3-57db-9a53-11e3564bf7a4"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--2","properties":[["name","Drop DLL files"],["description","When the Felismus executable is run, it deposits two Dynamic Link Library (DLL) files in the file system. The DLLs provide functions for the executable to call, allowing the original executable file to take up less disk space."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0005","technique":"T1129"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--0ce35aea-35a2-52ae-a67b-985306bdefe7","120":"instance--312639d5-e6d9-57b1-850d-28f0a1eac2f6","150":"instance--9551a25e-2558-512e-9894-dd64a8d662bf","180":"instance--403becce-e0ad-5dcd-bc14-7c00453907da","210":"instance--2305f501-2712-5ec6-9d4e-1371b011e937","240":"instance--cf1b8cf6-1cbd-5afb-b653-aa693889dab5","270":"instance--1d3dc59a-40a0-5670-aa3e-1304ff762003","30":"instance--77063d4f-503a-5e9b-b622-15aa2cc6a8e7","300":"instance--beaab67f-8a54-5982-8c5d-9d2ed2d42c9f","330":"instance--4d3274ff-ef14-5a53-99be-01575194a98e","60":"instance--4154a6bf-290b-5fce-a557-5dc0f3e700fb","90":"instance--2992bc0b-df57-54e5-a17b-03a964338c09"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--3","properties":[["name","Create invisible window"],["description","The malware creates an invisible window when it is run, camouflaging it as a Windows process by registering a WindowProc function to it. This enables the window to accept and process messages, which is how the malware communicates with its C2 server."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0005","technique":"T1036"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--0f6e4da7-a5f4-54d7-866f-3bc6e8bcb019","120":"instance--015254b5-0906-577e-b3e3-3899f837d118","150":"instance--f7af5b8c-330a-58d5-b0da-a3d5f0bc6ad0","180":"instance--9f27ab21-2382-567d-b022-74ad5a29bd08","210":"instance--d799eb0a-7600-5b1a-a298-c47a78ceae4b","240":"instance--911c2c52-5974-5e08-b0b6-a9084d57c6ee","270":"instance--286444b4-97a1-58cd-9ca3-cffa04a15351","30":"instance--92192c38-5143-50e0-8c39-a96ea86e32e2","300":"instance--82bb3de0-bea5-5651-a1de-583283258c6d","330":"instance--4f0945c8-f644-50ce-8796-fea52a29dda1","60":"instance--16c43a2d-7356-521d-a507-5922e2c3337b","90":"instance--abce5c62-339a-5ed5-a0b8-dd66136cfe2f"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--4","properties":[["name","Establish C2 communications"],["description","The original process sends encrypted commands through the invisible window to a domain, disguising the activity as normal browsing and shopping behavior. Because the activity is designed to look like normal, whitelisted behavior, antivirus products are unlikely to pick it up. Although the contents of these commands have not been deciphered, they appear to be related to the malware\u2019s setup process. In response, the server sets up a UUID for the victim, which is a unique identifier that is used later as part of the encryption process."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0011","technique":"T1071.001"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--a469636c-0cb2-50b9-92f9-644c8aa98197","120":"instance--d57b3a21-e910-5879-8148-40165cea451a","150":"instance--58250ef4-5bb4-5bf3-b33e-89493bbb395d","180":"instance--3e769cf2-c1e5-5d2e-81d4-892f48ce4d86","210":"instance--f6499e41-749c-5d7f-9346-96c08d0d5dfd","240":"instance--d9dcdfc8-5f42-546a-803a-0efcd5d4cf91","270":"instance--c9afd0f6-97ce-57b2-9d60-3557b6214809","30":"instance--75f82155-f5ff-5619-8bf8-aae22937cab0","300":"instance--25e2d26e-1b35-56bd-b9aa-096c2d3b0e3c","330":"instance--e0483688-da10-5376-8cf2-050bcc3b70f0","60":"instance--1293d9cc-16b2-5c67-a453-bd144aab133a","90":"instance--2b43cd52-10db-5b15-8ad5-c4b59496528b"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--5","properties":[["name","Execute shell command"],["description","Once communication has been established, the attacker can execute a shell command, save the results of the shell command, upload those results to a remote server, download a file from a remote server, execute a file, and create and save a text file."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0002","technique":"T1059"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--54fc1f38-f4e3-523e-b07c-73889b0d8df7","120":"instance--9cf45948-7040-5d7a-a1d5-3cb4db0c1af6","150":"instance--13bb13cc-e02b-51d2-8d7d-40e5613b6e5a","180":"instance--e33bc6ee-771e-54fe-a772-74dfdaad420d","210":"instance--286f51a3-8fc6-55ec-978e-8b05ebda3655","240":"instance--14659696-be77-5460-beb1-4b5eac126e43","270":"instance--f48ed1a6-2895-5cd2-9b1c-e30ac2bc8921","30":"instance--7b803e61-16ac-5720-92cd-8f2a456a52b7","300":"instance--76c24361-5143-5c43-8e4d-707c619e6038","330":"instance--f395cfc7-395a-5001-9552-a4fec6dbc53a","60":"instance--760885bb-9294-5a5b-93a2-a410e1ea4112","90":"instance--8e0d1a12-8611-598d-9a7d-40f2525e4781"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--6","properties":[["name","Save command results"],["description","Once communication has been established, the attacker can execute a shell command, save the results of the shell command, upload those results to a remote server, download a file from a remote server, execute a file, and create and save a text file."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0009","technique":"T1005"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--7cccbcd0-a724-54fb-be4f-ac523d26f7d0","120":"instance--738e44b2-1357-5eb3-82bd-8a0ce8942b72","150":"instance--d31f4735-6339-5929-8d7c-d30863cf166f","180":"instance--2252393d-d801-5931-ad38-4b53374a9880","210":"instance--065b5ad5-023a-5336-b458-e9c9dcda2976","240":"instance--5ea0dd2b-5eac-51f8-855a-4cbcb801bc2d","270":"instance--bba66874-a069-56c6-bb95-967cb3cefc9e","30":"instance--6377c09d-ecb4-5567-a2f4-4dde56ff4f98","300":"instance--ede3430f-b16b-58ae-be71-1d1f1a194336","330":"instance--7772f482-8ee2-569a-b600-7528c065d4e0","60":"instance--98139a98-16b0-54fe-8c77-3473c1b520cd","90":"instance--5cb9cc95-e190-5a68-985d-0a94d39299e6"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--7","properties":[["name","Upload results to remote server"],["description","Once communication has been established, the attacker can execute a shell command, save the results of the shell command, upload those results to a remote server, download a file from a remote server, execute a file, and create and save a text file."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0010","technique":"T1041"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--5150f7cc-6f25-5eb3-a6fc-5099ced4caf4","120":"instance--64a408ce-c543-55d6-a9dd-206ce7cadbb2","150":"instance--1b71e413-cfd2-528c-8792-dc7dd1bb9938","180":"instance--aa12ce11-0165-52b6-b72d-e4d9070e9fbb","210":"instance--5d8b0f08-14bc-58f4-9316-b25a92dd09a6","240":"instance--34f96b84-9453-53f2-ae07-d28c04665e6c","270":"instance--415f1d54-1cd4-5ba7-8071-4aa99bc946ac","30":"instance--18834cac-b4c4-57b0-88ea-5a62fdb27cf9","300":"instance--de4f9957-1ac6-5782-86ea-f1a3b6a9ad13","330":"instance--8eff940b-86bb-556f-8c85-c7c47577b3ed","60":"instance--14a123fd-5626-5e69-8257-6dcd64c28ec0","90":"instance--02294ff1-7261-5db8-8e0d-b9e818922053"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--8","properties":[["name","Download file from remote server"],["description","Once communication has been established, the attacker can execute a shell command, save the results of the shell command, upload those results to a remote server, download a file from a remote server, execute a file, and create and save a text file."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0011","technique":"T1105"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--180f2983-9c1a-56f4-99d6-c990125f7baa","120":"instance--c7f65318-7600-57f4-a8ac-992357e695ff","150":"instance--95523e1a-0a1d-52ef-944c-23f9cbc50233","180":"instance--bc8eb48d-411d-5877-aa9b-966476b71207","210":"instance--4cc5026e-07f9-5327-9912-5d278a0a3321","240":"instance--d6a7d51d-39a4-5eb3-8831-f23437781b95","270":"instance--cac30e05-5f01-5b4f-b5c0-6b975297df2d","30":"instance--cb0751b0-c027-5895-a460-a72e48920c71","300":"instance--f41cdc1f-abb7-5ff7-81c2-bf2235a7faab","330":"instance--b114cbda-9ec8-5612-b2f8-93c36811cafb","60":"instance--f28e5296-2041-5fe9-992d-4c70d549191e","90":"instance--3ea39244-da0f-5435-8745-f2afa8b13872"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--9","properties":[["name","Execute downloaded file"],["description","Once communication has been established, the attacker can execute a shell command, save the results of the shell command, upload those results to a remote server, download a file from a remote server, execute a file, and create and save a text file."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0002","technique":"T1204.002"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--db5fab04-54d4-5eec-a429-185861eb2719","120":"instance--985391bd-d017-5935-ab31-3b4b56331b02","150":"instance--092bb98d-fc30-5f69-b6b7-e3024f3ec65a","180":"instance--755129e6-612e-5b63-a780-1c886d98909b","210":"instance--431723d9-dd8c-5190-9dab-6f346173c044","240":"instance--5b9fb821-54fe-5f22-bba3-038263245910","270":"instance--3c6777cb-6430-544b-b31a-01b198524553","30":"instance--c070071b-a9a3-52fe-8956-a51744db200b","300":"instance--a9a4289c-d995-5783-9544-a8b45052eb56","330":"instance--344009cc-e024-5c68-9246-51e85e00d45c","60":"instance--86c77621-2c1d-59c3-b398-e62f4b48a3dd","90":"instance--67627b08-1913-5f3d-8318-52d3bda9c1c3"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--10","properties":[["name","Create and save text file"],["description","Once communication has been established, the attacker can execute a shell command, save the results of the shell command, upload those results to a remote server, download a file from a remote server, execute a file, and create and save a text file."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0040","technique":"T1565.001"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--6b7baffd-afaf-5472-9af2-a263119a77ef","120":"instance--83f38e63-e29a-53f4-99d9-927a195c453f","150":"instance--3e720145-b7a1-5bd6-8a7d-bb13519675d1","180":"instance--bdce060f-d96c-5b06-b8f4-1ab1527fd01d","210":"instance--a4feb251-e6e3-5680-a712-d59c92f73ccf","240":"instance--9a564ca6-b753-5b06-880c-b3aac25c1e73","270":"instance--76861a89-f006-5e0d-8c5b-ebdcb5e926dc","30":"instance--cf41e64d-4a4b-58d9-9962-72d278b2c489","300":"instance--ac1d6edd-482f-5f13-9348-b605afcc260c","330":"instance--ed78dfa1-f300-564f-b2cd-6c99552b9a68","60":"instance--979accb3-1b3e-5af4-9182-78392cbaf904","90":"instance--ae721c42-320e-5ea4-9c77-339a05b6e12f"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--11","properties":[["name","Add functional modules"],["description","Once Felismus has compromised a system, an attacker can easily add a new functional module designed to accomplish whatever they want within the environment. This could be a keylogger, a network traffic analyzer, a tool to automate exploration of the system, or anything else the attacker might want."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0011","technique":"T1105"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--f1e35721-7ac2-54fe-bcf6-5456d2faeaa3","120":"instance--3ff6777e-fcba-5b31-bf0f-3ddf77f6030d","150":"instance--cc6192f9-21a5-5d1a-b954-6a52d989b82d","180":"instance--62a87260-0181-5f49-bc05-733216e4d822","210":"instance--2f2d05c5-8e60-5ac2-b7af-e03027d67957","240":"instance--79c1ec18-d792-5d3d-a7bc-d94fe8b124cf","270":"instance--a035d357-e930-5d33-ab8d-d0314092d036","30":"instance--3af551b8-f6ac-5f54-9f6d-403fecdc69eb","300":"instance--298b5d2a-bf93-51e9-b052-19ce36114a5d","330":"instance--c8ea0da0-a19a-5766-b0d1-8524844a59d1","60":"instance--a204f87d-ace7-5a9e-b3d1-13202bdc5c7b","90":"instance--fff4de11-3f84-52c8-bb77-192210612a62"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--12","properties":[["name","Self-update malware"],["description","Felismus is also capable of self-updating, which means \u00ad\u00ad\u00adit can be updated to strengthen itself, fix bugs, or even change what it looks like to evade antivirus products."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0005","technique":"T1036"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--cac05670-e90e-512c-99cc-c0adf909c3ef","120":"instance--43922820-ddd3-5742-a88d-49c20f8e3fd5","150":"instance--884271a6-8d7b-5c96-9ece-61be4126898b","180":"instance--373a94ef-653d-5c24-96f7-d0cf326d3aea","210":"instance--e58b782a-e75e-5141-bdf0-6d47dbed96bd","240":"instance--5960e46a-3307-5101-b96f-f1bae10e323d","270":"instance--a5ae1125-6ca5-54f1-b9d3-0091a0a38367","30":"instance--e7c521dd-fe09-528b-bb67-1ec53389b876","300":"instance--582e0864-cb5c-5de1-b6c0-e162ae91e8bc","330":"instance--3d5550f3-3e33-5d71-b71e-db2a0a957e5e","60":"instance--b83fc757-0bd4-5b63-a13e-e5b8ef5956d2","90":"instance--2a745819-837b-5585-a366-81a34117a6e5"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--13","properties":[["name","Detect antivirus processes"],["description","Felismus appears to detect processes associated with popular antivirus programs, presumably to avoid them."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0007","technique":"T1518.001"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--35652c79-2c41-5d60-81ba-b5e47aa554bf","120":"instance--53906203-fffb-5af3-b112-44a9b4b49b8f","150":"instance--465fbc8a-7b4c-569f-be00-c0fbc137fcfc","180":"instance--a653c96b-3673-5dfa-968e-188fffe4cc04","210":"instance--6a344cf5-bd5c-52db-84f5-23c7701c7a5e","30":"instance--913561d1-b5f3-54d2-8272-159233dfde54","330":"instance--d59fe52d-c897-5f3a-919a-c2273cb8a8b3","60":"instance--f1fd6a3d-bb83-543d-a379-39d4632978f7","90":"instance--4cd6fce2-0d24-57f0-b161-12a867cd1100","branch:False":"instance--f7e897b3-3607-5ea5-8d15-5f83ba8a60da","branch:True":"instance--39b5ac19-b0dd-5674-a7d9-d75e659fe9ea"},"id":"condition","instance":"attack-condition--1","properties":[["description","When the Felismus executable is run"]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--2ff8b105-17d8-5bc8-9736-a71ca9281068","120":"instance--fe9b11f7-9a07-51c8-93b2-02f34148833b","150":"instance--15f0676c-2f2f-58cf-99a3-b5eade2d286e","180":"instance--cdc5e3d9-a0b4-5995-98a3-d1a29532ffb1","210":"instance--75ed5df8-ff2f-5667-9748-b8587a1ee318","30":"instance--46009917-4258-54e5-9e91-c46c4a45d34d","330":"instance--54845373-a5f0-5af0-b348-5b0a3b4fbe67","60":"instance--f1f8d9a5-1f2a